:["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7367801,"initDialog":736780101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[30246],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Mengde_73678/Q7367801","priority":5,"questId":73678,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":736780101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30247,"speakerName":"Farabi","textMapHash":3328426442,"text":"You're here, Traveler.","nextNodeIds":[736780102]},{"nodeId":736780102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30247,"speakerName":"Farabi","textMapHash":1488474810,"text":"Here's some good news. Because people have found concrete evidence of the survival of Snowboars, I just received a letter from my mentor saying that my thesis has been approved.","nextNodeIds":[736780103]},{"nodeId":736780103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1873722698,"text":"Wow, sounds like everything's going smoothly for you, eh? Congrats!","nextNodeIds":[736780104]},{"nodeId":736780104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30247,"speakerName":"Farabi","textMapHash":3882025914,"text":"It's a good start, but the research that follows will take a long time, so I have to be prepared to stay in Mondstadt for a while.","nextNodeIds":[736780105]},{"nodeId":736780105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30247,"speakerName":"Farabi","textMapHash":542888186,"text":"Next, I have to figure out how the Snowboars managed to leave the snowy mountains and ended up in the forest.","nextNodeIds":[736780106]},{"nodeId":736780106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30247,"speakerName":"Farabi","textMapHash":488432898,"text":"Based on the tracks that have been found, I'm guessing that they descended the mountain from its western face, passed Dawn Winery, and then made their way to Springvale.","nextNodeIds":[736780107]},{"nodeId":736780107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30247,"speakerName":"Farabi","textMapHash":2384411194,"text":"If this hypothesis is correct, we should be able to find traces of them in the area. So, our goal today is to investigate this.","nextNodeIds":[736780108]},{"nodeId":736780108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4089363802,"text":"Paimon gets it. Uh, also, who is this guy beside you? He looks all dressed for a hunt.","nextNodeIds":[736780109]},{"nodeId":736780109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30246,"speakerName":"Walter","textMapHash":2168725738,"text":"Hello, my name is Walter. Recently, I've taken up the responsibility of overseeing security near Dawn Winery.","nextNodeIds":[736780110]},{"nodeId":736780110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30246,"speakerName":"Walter","textMapHash":113819082,"text":"Edmund told me that you guys are looking for Snowboars. Could you come with me today? I happen to need some extra hands to help out.","nextNodeIds":[736780111]},{"nodeId":736780111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30246,"speakerName":"Walter","textMapHash":2425516922,"text":"*sigh* Some Forest Boars broke into the nearby farms last night, scaring off all their pigeons and ducks. They still haven't found all of them.","nextNodeIds":[736780112]},{"nodeId":736780112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30246,"speakerName":"Walter","textMapHash":655397810,"text":"Traveler, when we are hunting later, please capture these small animals when you find them and bring them back with you.","nextNodeIds":[736780113]},{"nodeId":736780113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1648807906,"text":"Of course. It's my pleasure.","nextNodeIds":[736780114]},{"nodeId":736780114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30246,"speakerName":"Walter","textMapHash":1265278322,"text":"I heard that you know how to use hunting tools. I've got some around here too, so help yourself. We can set off once you're ready.","nextNodeIds":[736780115,736780116]},{"nodeId":736780115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":981405954,"text":"All ready! Let's go!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736780116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2155704546,"text":"Wait, I have other things to do.","nextNodeIds":[736780117]},{"nodeId":736780117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30246,"speakerName":"Walter","textMapHash":887034090,"text":"Yeah, take your time. I'll be waiting right here.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7367801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30246"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7367802,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Participate in the hunt near Dawn Winery","stepDescTextMapHash":2514775268,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2016,102],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ACTIVITY_TRIGGER_UPDATE","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30246"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2016,102],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_